# Git Workflow

- Create feature branches from `develop`: `git checkout -b feature/email-sync develop`
- Never push directly to `main` or `develop`
- Commit often with meaningful messages: `Add Gmail OAuth token refresh handler`
- Before PR: run `bench run-tests --app excom` and `bench build --app excom`
- PR title matches the feature/fix description
- Squash merge to develop, merge to main for releases
- Tag releases: `v0.1.0`, `v0.2.0` etc.
